    "detailed_description": "Get ready for your song to take off! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Soar Up The Charts, you take control of a band on the rise - gaining new weapons each time you add a new instrument (guitars, bass, vocals, etc) to the song. Look out though: every time your flyer gets hit, you lose part of your songs and your those power ups!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHUGE thanks to Alden Ave and Keep Flying for lending tracks to us to make this game come to life!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo turn it up to 11 and Rock on - it\u2019s time to Soar Up The Charts!",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready for your song to take off! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Soar Up The Charts, you take control of a band on the rise - gaining new weapons each time you add a new instrument (guitars, bass, vocals, etc) to the song. Look out though: every time your flyer gets hit, you lose part of your songs and your those power ups!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHUGE thanks to Alden Ave and Keep Flying for lending tracks to us to make this game come to life!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo turn it up to 11 and Rock on - it\u2019s time to Soar Up The Charts!",
    "short_description": "Soar Up The Charts is a fast-paced rhythm game and arcade style rail shooter where music is your weapon! \ud83c\udfb8With tracks provided by Alden Ave and KeepFlying, be ready to turn it up and blast your way through those radio robots! \ud83c\udfba",
